<article class="prose about-page">
<p class="eyebrow">The person behind the projects</p><h1>Hi, I'm Sam.</h1>
<p class="lede">I work in IT, build hardware, and spend a lot of time figuring out how to get things working. So far, that includes infrastructure and automation, a split keyboard with trackballs, drones, an antenna tracker, and more.</p>
<p>With the Tempest Dux, I barreled into designing/modifying a PCB and ended up with a lot more troubleshooting than I expected. It took a while, but I got it working and learned a ton. Now I'm working on the next version.</p>
<p>This site is where I share what I'm building, what went wrong, and what I'm trying next. When I'm building on someone else's work, I'll point you to it too.</p>
<p>I'm trying to keep this in mind: first make it exist, then make it work, then make it beautiful.</p>
